---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AuthorSidebar from '../components/AuthorSidebar.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="My ikigai: why I build, who I build for, and where passion, skill, and commercial judgment meet."
  image="/images/about-ikigai.webp"
>
  <div class="page-layout">
    <AuthorSidebar />
    <main class="page-content">
      <h1>My Ikigai</h1>

      <p>
        <img
          src="/images/about-ikigai.webp"
          alt="Tom Claudio's ikigai diagram — four circles (what I love, my tools, what the world needs, what I can be paid for) meeting at a center ringed by commercial judgment"
          width="1000"
          height="1000"
        />
      </p>

      <h2>Passion</h2>
      <h3>What I love × My tools</h3>

      <p>I love the act of invention itself — and code, data, and AI are how I bring it to life. Building a working system from nothing is where I lose track of time.</p>

      <h2>Mission</h2>
      <h3>What I love × What the world needs</h3>

      <p>I invent systems that make businesses more productive — but only the ones my commercial judgment says are worth building.</p>

      <h2>Profession</h2>
      <h3>My tools × What I can be paid for</h3>

      <p>An AI and software engineer with business acumen — I don't just build what's asked; I build what creates commercial value.</p>

      <h2>Vocation</h2>
      <h3>What the world needs × What I can be paid for</h3>

      <p>I get paid to deliver productivity that shows up in the P&amp;L — hours saved, margins gained.</p>

      <p>I am a creator. What I love is not any single craft but invention itself, taking something that doesn't exist, whether a system, a digital service, or a business, and building it into something real that produces value. My digital skills are the tools I build with, and my commercial judgment is the gate every idea must pass: it cuts the noise and keeps me building only what matters. What the world needs from me is productivity, every system I create helps a person or a business produce more with less.</p>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
